{"title":"Curriculum Vitae or Resume Format 1","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Curriculum Vitae or Resume Format 1","format":{"html":{"toc":true},"pdf":{"colorlinks":false,"mainfont":"Open Sans","include-in-header":{"text":"\\usepackage[lmargin = 0.7in,rmargin = 0.7in,\ntmargin =0.9in, bmargin = 0.9in]{geometry}\n\\usepackage{fancyhdr}\n\\pagestyle{fancy}\n\n\\fancyhf{}\n\\rhead{\\thepage}\n\\lhead{Name Name}\n\n\\makeatletter\n\\renewcommand\\maketitle{\n\\begin{center}\n{\\Large \\textbf{Name Name}}\\\\\n\\vspace{1mm}\n\\normalsize email\\\\\n\\vspace{1mm}\nUpdated Month YYYY\n\\end{center}}\n\\makeatother\n\n\\addtokomafont{disposition}{\\rmfamily}\n"}}},"format-links":["pdf"]},"headingText":"EDUCATION","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n::: {.content-hidden when-format=\"pdf\"}\nJust as with a standard cv or resume, use whatever headings and format makes the most sense for you. These sections are just examples. See [here](https://quarto.org/docs/authoring/markdown-basics.html) for an overview of markdown formatting in quarto.\n:::\n\n\n\n#### Instition, Location\nDegree, Field, Graduation Month YYYY\n\nOther Details\n\n#### Instition, Location\nDegree, Field, Graduation Month YYYY\n\nOther Details\n\n## RESEARCH EXPERIENCE\n\n### GRADUATE STUDENT RESEARCHER\n\n#### Project\nInstitution/Company,  Month YYYY -- Month YYYY\n\nSupervisor/Advisor/Mentor: Name (if this is relevant)\n\n- details\n\n#### Project\nInstitution/Company,  Month YYYY -- Month YYYY\n\nSupervisor/Advisor/Mentor: Name (if this is relevant)\n\n- details\n\n### UNDERGRADUATE STUDENT RESEARCHER\n\n#### Project\nInstitution/Company,  Month YYYY -- Month YYYY\n\nSupervisor/Advisor/Mentor: Name (if this is relevant)\n\n- details\n\n#### Project\nInstitution/Company,  Month YYYY -- Month YYYY\n\nSupervisor/Advisor/Mentor: Name (if this is relevant)\n\n- details\n\n## PUBLICATIONS\n\n**Your name**, Author (YYYY). [title](https://doi.org). *Journal.*\n\nAuthor, **Your name**, Author (YYYY). [title](https://doi.org). *Journal.*\n\n## TEACHING EXPERIENCE\n\n## PRESENTATIONS AND POSTERS\n\n### PRESENTATIONS\n\n#### [Talk Name](https://github.com) \nEvent/Conference, Location, Month YYYY\n\nEvent/Conference, Location, Month YYYY\n\n#### Talk Name\nEvent/Conference, Location, Month YYYY\n\n### POSTERS\n\n#### [Poster Name](https://github.com) \nEvent/Conference, Location, Month YYYY\n\n## PROFESSIONAL SERVICE\n\n### Institution\n\nRole, Committee/Group, Month YYYY -- Month YYYY\n\nRole, Committee/Group, Month YYYY -- Month YYYY\n\n### Institution/National Organization\n\nRole, Committee/Group, Month YYYY -- Month YYYY\n\n### Reviewer\n\nJournal\n\n\n::: {.content-hidden when-format=\"html\"}\n## References\nAvailable upon request\n:::\n\n::: {.content-hidden when-format=\"pdf\"}\nHTML/PDF formatting option inspired by [this page](https://www.cynthiahqy.com/posts/cv-html-pdf/).\n:::\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n::: {.content-hidden when-format=\"pdf\"}\nJust as with a standard cv or resume, use whatever headings and format makes the most sense for you. These sections are just examples. See [here](https://quarto.org/docs/authoring/markdown-basics.html) for an overview of markdown formatting in quarto.\n:::\n\n\n## EDUCATION\n\n#### Instition, Location\nDegree, Field, Graduation Month YYYY\n\nOther Details\n\n#### Instition, Location\nDegree, Field, Graduation Month YYYY\n\nOther Details\n\n## RESEARCH EXPERIENCE\n\n### GRADUATE STUDENT RESEARCHER\n\n#### Project\nInstitution/Company,  Month YYYY -- Month YYYY\n\nSupervisor/Advisor/Mentor: Name (if this is relevant)\n\n- details\n\n#### Project\nInstitution/Company,  Month YYYY -- Month YYYY\n\nSupervisor/Advisor/Mentor: Name (if this is relevant)\n\n- details\n\n### UNDERGRADUATE STUDENT RESEARCHER\n\n#### Project\nInstitution/Company,  Month YYYY -- Month YYYY\n\nSupervisor/Advisor/Mentor: Name (if this is relevant)\n\n- details\n\n#### Project\nInstitution/Company,  Month YYYY -- Month YYYY\n\nSupervisor/Advisor/Mentor: Name (if this is relevant)\n\n- details\n\n## PUBLICATIONS\n\n**Your name**, Author (YYYY). [title](https://doi.org). *Journal.*\n\nAuthor, **Your name**, Author (YYYY). [title](https://doi.org). *Journal.*\n\n## TEACHING EXPERIENCE\n\n## PRESENTATIONS AND POSTERS\n\n### PRESENTATIONS\n\n#### [Talk Name](https://github.com) \nEvent/Conference, Location, Month YYYY\n\nEvent/Conference, Location, Month YYYY\n\n#### Talk Name\nEvent/Conference, Location, Month YYYY\n\n### POSTERS\n\n#### [Poster Name](https://github.com) \nEvent/Conference, Location, Month YYYY\n\n## PROFESSIONAL SERVICE\n\n### Institution\n\nRole, Committee/Group, Month YYYY -- Month YYYY\n\nRole, Committee/Group, Month YYYY -- Month YYYY\n\n### Institution/National Organization\n\nRole, Committee/Group, Month YYYY -- Month YYYY\n\n### Reviewer\n\nJournal\n\n\n::: {.content-hidden when-format=\"html\"}\n## References\nAvailable upon request\n:::\n\n::: {.content-hidden when-format=\"pdf\"}\nHTML/PDF formatting option inspired by [this page](https://www.cynthiahqy.com/posts/cv-html-pdf/).\n:::\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":false,"echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-